# Host helper binaries for the Linux arm64 desktop-as-host image (Plan 3 Task 5):
#   supermux-broker   — the compiled Bun broker (scripts/build-binary.sh)
#   tmux              — static tmux
#   frpc              — frp 0.61.1 client
# Staged by scripts/stage-desktop-binaries.sh in CI before packageDeb; large native
# binaries, never committed (mirrors the release binary + JBR/JCEF, which are built/fetched,
# not checked in). This .gitignore keeps the dir tracked so appResourcesRootDir resolves.
*
!.gitignore
